 "text": "**Reasoning for each question:**\n\n1. Cauliflower mosaic virus is a DNA plant virus. Answer: **C**.\n2. The textbook range for X-rays is 1.0×10⁻² nm to 10 nm. Answer: **B**.\n3. Golpata (Nypa palm) is a mangrove plant. Answer: **B**.\n4. Fe²⁺, Fe³⁺ and Al³⁺ are used as coagulant ions in effluent treatment plants; Na⁺ is not. Answer: **D**.\n5. Hydra's bud is used for asexual reproduction. Answer: **A**.\n6. The question refers to a grid that wasn't provided. A 5×5 grid contains 55 squares, so this is a best guess. Answer: **C**.\n7. ChatGPT is the AI program. Answer: **B**.\n8. Thylakoids are found in chloroplasts. Answer: **A**.\n9. PERMUTATION has 6 consonants (P, R, M, T, T, N), with T repeated. They can be arranged in 6!/2! = 360 ways. Excluding the original arrangement gives 359. Answer: **B**.\n10. The Great Hall of the People is in China. Answer: **C**.\n11. Taking glass's refractive index as 1.5, the wavelength is 4800/1.5 = 3200 Å. Answer: **C**.\n12. Ornithine is a non-protein amino acid. Answer: **C**.\n13. The head of Bangladesh Bank is called the Governor. Answer: **C**.\n14. ΔT = gh/c = (9.8 × 100)/4200 ≈ 0.233 °C. Answer: **B**.\n15. For y = x + 1/x, dy/dx = 1 − 1/x² = 0, so x = 1. Answer: **B**.\n\n{\"answers\": {\"14b057ae-8f27-4763-8db0-d989fe3f683d-135402\": \"C\", \"14bf14c2-db1d-4023-87e2-550b8dfd1ef4-141190\": \"B\", \"1530071b-4e4c-4c1a-8278-1bc0d71a923b-146020\": \"B\", \"1642de87-da58-43b2-9d7c-f894c999c20a-79520\": \"D\", \"1695f409-3a9b-4aa8-ba84-9a297cd1ffbe-787\": \"A\", \"172e8bfc-c8fd-43c9-8be7-ebcfcf826857-129626\": \"C\", \"17ca40af-18e3-4a50-ac99-df4408196959-135284\": \"B\", \"18e642f4-3c84-4119-898d-730dba46b516-61284\": \"A\", \"1acba9c4-cc34-47c9-8a9e-4c61d6fdb8f3-129932\": \"B\", \"1b54ae2f-5d16-467a-b37d-8ce01a6f98cb-113005\": \"C\", \"1b5eb72d-64dc-4c86-bf00-2b2429923ed3-23579\": \"C\", \"1b6ae479-484b-4ac3-92ee-38d2b53163f7-65938\": \"C\", \"1d54b344-6736-47ef-b860-451dad6be1d3-105153\": \"C\", \"1d9b0927-6091-4f8